 "about_text": "Château Shatto is a contemporary art gallery based in Los Angeles that represents an international group of artists working across painting, sculpture, video, and installation. Its roster includes Aria Dean, Fiona Connor, Van Hanos, Helen Johnson, C.B. Evans, Cécile B. Evans, and the late Jacqueline de Jong, alongside a growing list of emerging names, with photographer John Divola joining the program in 2026. The gallery frequently presents artists' work at international institutions such as the Hammer Museum, Renaissance Society, ICA London, and Serralves Museum, and participates in art fairs including Art Basel and FIAC/OFFICIELLE. Its exhibitions and programming, including screenings and curated group shows, reflect an interest in conceptually driven, research-based practices spanning painting, sculpture, moving image, and site-specific installation.",
